  "audio": "public/audio/airplane-ashtray.wav",
  "duration": 21.743,
  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Smoking has been banned on flights for decades,",
      "start": 0.071,
      "end": 2.16
    },
    {
      "text": "and there is still an ashtray built into the",
      "start": 2.44,
      "end": 3.977
    },
    {
      "text": "airplane bathroom door.",
      "start": 4.03,
      "end": 5.031
    },
    {
      "text": "It is not a leftover nobody removed.",
      "start": 5.288,
      "end": 6.967
    },
    {
      "text": "Regulators require it,",
      "start": 7.269,
      "end": 8.25
    },
    {
      "text": "and a plane can be held on the ground",
      "start": 8.432,
      "end": 9.825
    },
    {
      "text": "over a broken one.",
      "start": 9.878,
      "end": 10.61
    },
    {
      "text": "The reasoning is bleak and completely correct.",
      "start": 10.825,
      "end": 12.718
    },
    {
      "text": "Somebody is eventually going to smoke in there",
      "start": 13.05,
      "end": 14.513
    },
    {
      "text": "anyway,",
      "start": 14.549,
      "end": 14.959
    },
    {
      "text": "and the only question is where the cigarette",
      "start": 15.086,
      "end": 16.426
    },
    {
      "text": "ends up.",
      "start": 16.479,
      "end": 16.951
    },
    {
      "text": "Without an ashtray,",
      "start": 17.097,
      "end": 17.901
    },
    {
      "text": "it goes in the bin, on top of the",
      "start": 18.079,
      "end": 19.419
    },
    {
      "text": "paper towels.",
      "start": 19.473,
      "end": 20.062
    },
    {
      "text": "It is not there for smokers.",
      "start": 20.316,
      "end": 21.514
    }
  ],
